1Sa 18:1 , Jonathan loves David;
1Sa 18:5 , Saul envies his praise;
1Sa 18:10 , seeks to kill him in his fury;
1Sa 18:12 , fears him for his good success;
1Sa 18:17 , offers him his daughters for a snare;
1Sa 18:23 , David persuaded to be the king's son-in-law, gives two hundred foreskins of the Philistines for Michal's dowry;
1Sa 18:28 , Saul's hatred and David's glory increase.
